 "text_original": "Grok built this layer. It worked under a written contract, in bounded slices, each logged with a UTC time. It read Zetaris's own agent rules first, then registered the sources, defined the semantic layer and its data-quality rules, and checked every step against the live local API. Where it could not verify something, the verdict file says so.",
